                                                                                                                                                                [1B  [38;5;231mCurrent state (from AGENTS.md §5 + git status):[39m                                                                                                                                                       [1B  [38;5;231m- Test coverage: ~30% → P1 target: >50% for `nexus_core` / `agent_bus`[39m                                                                                                                                [1B  [38;5;231m- `M code` / `M wiki` — submodule uncommitted changes present[39m                                                                                                                                         [1B  [38;5;231m- Drift healing and cross-validation routines still in progress[39m                                                                                                                                       [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B  [38;5;231m## Tasks[39m                                                                                                                                                                                              [1B                                                                                                                                                                                                        [1B  [38;5;231m1. **Assess current state**[39m                                                                                                                                                                           [1B  [38;5;231m   - Check `git status` in code/ and wiki/ submodules — identify what's dirty[39m    